{%- comment -%}
  Header blocks for the end to end tests, built around one conversation
  so the ids line up.

  Every address is on tests.invalid, which RFC 2606 reserves so that it
  can never belong to anyone. That is also what the sweep matches on, so
  a record created here is always identifiable as ours.

  Excluded from the linter in .platformos-check.yml, like the module's own
  fixtures: a real Message-ID is not parseable as HTML.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture opening -%}
Return-Path: <rita@tests.invalid>
From: Rita Alvarez <rita@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Cc: colleague@tests.invalid
Subject: Lift is stuck between floors
Message-ID: <rita-001@tests.invalid>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture reply_by_header -%}
Return-Path: <rita@tests.invalid>
From: Rita Alvarez <rita@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Subject: Re: Lift is stuck between floors
Message-ID: <rita-002@tests.invalid>
In-Reply-To: <rita-001@tests.invalid>
References: <rita-001@tests.invalid>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture reply_by_subject -%}
Return-Path: <rita@tests.invalid>
From: Rita Alvarez <rita@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Subject: RE: Lift is stuck between floors
Message-ID: <rita-003@tests.invalid>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture stranger_with_token -%}
Return-Path: <stranger@tests.invalid>
From: A Stranger <stranger@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Subject: RE: Lift is stuck between floors
Message-ID: <stranger-001@tests.invalid>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture colleague_in_thread -%}
Return-Path: <newcomer@tests.invalid>
From: A Newcomer <newcomer@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Subject: Re: Lift is stuck between floors
Message-ID: <newcomer-001@tests.invalid>
In-Reply-To: <rita-001@tests.invalid>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture out_of_office -%}
Return-Path: <away@tests.invalid>
From: Someone Away <away@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Subject: Automatic reply: Lift is stuck between floors
Message-ID: <away-001@tests.invalid>
Auto-Submitted: auto-replied
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture a_forward -%}
Return-Path: <rita@tests.invalid>
From: Rita Alvarez <rita@tests.invalid>
To: general@inbound.example.com
Subject: Fwd: something else entirely
Message-ID: <rita-fwd-001@tests.invalid>
{%- endcapture -%}
{% liquid
  assign blocks = { "opening": opening, "reply_by_header": reply_by_header, "reply_by_subject": reply_by_subject, "stranger_with_token": stranger_with_token, "colleague_in_thread": colleague_in_thread, "out_of_office": out_of_office, "a_forward": a_forward }
  return blocks
%}
